+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-1hf.1","local_name":"sase-1hf.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-1hf","agent_clan_generation":"20261007144834","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-1hf.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-1hf[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Repair the wait lane so waiting agents wake on completion, not on [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]the fallback[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Agent dependency waits are released by wait_checks within seconds [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]of the dependency finishing (instead of by the runner's 60 s [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fallback), ready.json publication is race-free, every release [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]records its source and latency, and wait_checks runs in its own [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fast lane resolving only live waiters.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]wait_lane_repair.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/wait_lane_repair.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1hf[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1hf/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Race-free ready.json publication and reading[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]atomic-ready[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]atomic-ready: publish ready.json via temp file plus no-clobber link, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skip publishing once the waiter is gone, and make the runner treat [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unreadable or malformed ready.json as not ready.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Point wait_checks and bead_claim_checks at the completion [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]pulse[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]pulse-trigger[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pulse-trigger: replace the blind ace-run/* fs glob with the per-project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF].ace_refresh_pulse, touch the pulse on dependency waiting-marker writes,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]audit done.json writers, and rewrite the trigger tests on the real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]YYYYMM/DD/<run> layout.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record wait release source and latency (research Phase 0)[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]release-telemetry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after atomic-ready[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]release-telemetry: stamp wait_release_source, dependency-satisfied time,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]release latency, admission latency, and runner-slot wait into [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent_meta.json; wait_checks adds released_by and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dependencies_satisfied_at to ready.json.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve only live waiters from a filesystem view[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live-waiters[dim] · [dim][/dim]after release-telemetry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-waiters: shared waiting-marker walk plus tri-state runner liveness,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skip dead waiters and the dependency-view build when no live waiter is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending, build the resolving view from filesystem rows instead of the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]slow index query, add backlog counters, and reuse the walk in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar_auto_sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Give wait_checks and sidecar_auto_sync their own routines[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]lane-split[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pulse-trigger, live-waiters[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane-split: new agent_waits (2 s) and sidecar_sync (30 s) routines, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-sync beads pulse, 0.5 s ready.json poll in the runner, test and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs updates, and the consolidated PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP list.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1hf","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1hf.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e478d038900c2e9ba74eb4fdaf2bfc5f","started_at":"2026-10-07T19:10:48.887815+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"71163053d73eb786ade1a853e1504726d3a19d1d9cc0aac85b92ba2db8712a52","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1hf.3--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":15702},"commits":{"digest":"e41b028d4c7c370d3765b4e35e8269c27eaeac2991b99ef8a9d25ab906d0a01c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1hf.3--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"0233c008c30287b7e84d03e17d4d7cb920995fbd08c7120039fe3295d86d35ac","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1hf.3--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":752},"state":{"digest":"8c2362efa58d13f9f2be6e589e456f72809dbd109a6c8b90962c6b6778d038bb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1hf.3--mon/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-10-07T20:20:13.711040+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-1hf.3--mon","local_name":"sase-1hf.3--mon","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-1hf","agent_clan_generation":"20261007144834","agent_session":"sase-1hf.3","agent_session_role":"mon","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-1hf.3","ch